  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOHK FULL GRANT 2024/25 NEXTGEN GENDER MASCULINITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NxtGenMen project in South Africa, implemented by the School of Hard Knocks (SoHK), aims to contribute to bringing about change in attitudes towards gender and masculinity. The objective of the grant is to promote positive masculinity and improve mental health amongst men in South Africa for men and boys from the townships that surround Cape Town and on the Cape Flats in the Province of Western Cape. The key activities include direct delivery of NxtGenMen (NGM) programmes (NGM workshops: traditional and lite) by the SoHK; train the trainer workshops for SoHK partner organisations delivered in partnership SOHK partner organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
